.\" Manpage for rulmee
.\" https://github.com/BeniaminK/rulmee
.TH rulmee 1

.SH NAME
rulmee \- A text based display manager written in Rust


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBrulmee\fP [TTY]


.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBrulmee\fP is a text based display manager written in Rust that supports extensive configuration and themes. Its focus is to be simple, secure, and customizable.


.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
\fB[TTY]\fP
TTY to switch to, does not mean that it will run in it.

.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
\fBRULMEE_CONF\fP
Specify the config file path (default: \fI/etc/rulmee/default.toml\fP).
.TP
\fBRULMEE_LOG\fP
Optionally, a path to output logs and failures.

.SH FILES
.TP
\fI/etc/rulmee/default.toml\fP
Config file, see
.BR rulmee-config (5)
for syntax.


.SH NOTES
.SS "Service Files"
To configure startup behaviour for your init system, see
.BR https://github.com/BeniaminK/rulmee/tree/main/assets/services


.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR rulmee-config (5)
.PP
The upstream GitHub repository can be found at
.BR https://github.com/BeniaminK/rulmee
